izioni di Marta","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Minako decides to work for the Three Lights as their personal assistant thinking it will help her quickly get into the entertainment industry. But Minkao soon realizes that being a star isn't all fun and glamor.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1996-05-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o57saTEWi550mAG5h1SZhR1n7jE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o57saTEWi550mAG5h1SZhR1n7jE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/3570/season/5/episode/9"},{"id":"992549","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Il musical","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Three Lights are rehearsing for their upcoming musical, which they will be starring in. But they seem to have a hard time winning the approval of the stage director, especially Seiya, who feels that he is being personally tested.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1996-06-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/90x0HwRWK7pW0vzUblTyWcyDyLH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/90x0HwRWK7pW0vzUblTyWcyDyLH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/3570/season/5/episode/10"},{"id":"992551","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"La cometa di Wataru","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ami invited Taiki to come and watch the Wataru's Comet pass by Earth with their science teacher, Amanogawa, only to be rejected.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1996-06-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/klUQEafXrUzdor78syg74m7f2kd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/klUQEafXrUzdor78syg74m7f2kd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/3570/sea