ornata insieme","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Seiya asks Usagi on a date, to which she reluctantly agrees. Sailor Iron Mouse attempts to make up for her recent failures by going after Seiya's star seed.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1996-07-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r6ssgKRGnAIDgUe1nk8txrmsND9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r6ssgKRGnAIDgUe1nk8txrmsND9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/3570/season/5/episode/15"},{"id":"992556","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Arriva Chibi Chibi","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Usagi and Lina encounters a little girl who appears to be lost. The two later return home that day and are surprised to find the same girl now living in Usagi's house as her younger sister.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1996-08-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9UL590UlHr8yvG8RZ6miPX4td7o.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9UL590UlHr8yvG8RZ6miPX4td7o.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/3570/season/5/episode/16"},{"id":"992557","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Vacanze al lago","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Over the summer, the girls go camping in the mountains, where they run into the Three Lights, who are there shooting for an upcoming film.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1996-08-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i6MqRBSbSXwnYttwRfxDQzDx1LT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i6MqRBSbSXwnYttwRfxDQzDx1LT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/3570/season/5/episode/17"},{"id":"992558","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value