Number":5,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"La grande partita","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Usagi finds herself teamed up with Seiya for the annual school softball tournament. To make matters worse, Isagi becomes a target of Seiya's fans, who think she is hitting on him.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1996-09-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3X9363QEcG7YCd3vSyyUZoPNKC7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3X9363QEcG7YCd3vSyyUZoPNKC7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/3570/season/5/episode/21"},{"id":"992562","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Pericolo ad alta quota","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sailor Aluminum Siren learns that Usagi is Sailor Moon. Using this knowledge, she sets a trap on a plane where the Three Lights are holding an in-flight event in order to get Usagi's attention.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1996-09-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hPmaFI4F5FSxlTPYFZpXZYg2bF4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hPmaFI4F5FSxlTPYFZpXZYg2bF4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/3570/season/5/episode/22"},{"id":"992563","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Rea la veggente","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Inner Senshi and the Starlights learn each others real identities, but distrust each other, Usagi and Seiya try to bring both groups together.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1996-10-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fsbchM5cnMQnRXMbRW03QFMQgzq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fsbchM5cnMQnRXMbRW03QFMQgzq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/3570/sea